# Telegraph Narrows (CIPlay telegraph_narrows; in the plan after Sorting Rock): quest "Down the Line"
# West headland (stack 1, 20 m) at -34 0 with the first hut, stacks 2-7 at x -20..20 (18..10 m), the east headland
# (stack 8, 7 m) at 34 0 with the last hut and Holger's cage.
island Telegraph Narrows
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title Down the Line
zone first_hut
expect step 1
read Telegraph code sheet
expect step 2
use linehub
expect message line is dead
use generator
expect story linepower 1
expect step 3
zone stack_4
expect step 4
use linehub
expect story linewire 1
expect step 5
kill Screecher
expect animals Screecher 0
expect step 6
zone last_hut
expect step 7
open Telegraph cabinet
expect message locked
code cabinetpad 1111 wrong
code cabinetpad 7241
open Telegraph cabinet
wait 3
expect item Blueprint_WindTurbine 1
expect item Blueprint_BatteryAdvanced 1
expect item Blueprint_HeadLight_Advanced 1
expect item Blueprint_ElectricGrill 1
expect step 13
open Holger's kit
expect message still in the cage
use holgercage
expect survivor lastpost_holger
open Holger's kit
expect done
